    "detailed_description": "This is a first person, physics simulation based puzzle game. Gain unique powers along the way, and solve puzzle using these powers in creative ways. At certain checkpoints, player must answer riddles and questions which test your intelligence and morality. The beta version contains around 10-20 hours of gameplay, depending on how quickly you solve each puzzle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will use different abilities such as telekinesis, magnetism, time slowdown, time reversal, scale change, and portal creation to solve puzzles. These powers affect in-game objects in different meaningful ways and enable the player to progress through the level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nController Support Coming soon!",
    "about_the_game": "This is a first person, physics simulation based puzzle game. Gain unique powers along the way, and solve puzzle using these powers in creative ways. At certain checkpoints, player must answer riddles and questions which test your intelligence and morality. The beta version contains around 10-20 hours of gameplay, depending on how quickly you solve each puzzle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will use different abilities such as telekinesis, magnetism, time slowdown, time reversal, scale change, and portal creation to solve puzzles. These powers affect in-game objects in different meaningful ways and enable the player to progress through the level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nController Support Coming soon!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the Simulation! A first person, physics simulation based puzzle game where you solve puzzles and answer riddles which will test your creativity and intelligence. Gain unique powers along the way. Each puzzle is different and there are multiple ways to solve them. Good Luck!",
